        "original_id": "8944123d-c80e-50fb-8789-e325b8d801cb",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Walter Murch, Gill Dennis, Paul Maslansky, Brian Fee, Kiel Murray, Bob Peterson, Mike Rich, Fiona Victory\n- Films: Return to Oz, Cars 3, Cars, Cars 2, Swept from the Sea\n- Characters: Lightning McQueen\n- Topics: film direction, screenwriting, production, acting roles\n\nFacts:\n- Return to Oz is a 1985 fantasy adventure film directed and written by Walter Murch, co-written by Gill Dennis, and produced by Paul Maslansky.\n- Fiona Victory appeared in the 1985 film Return to Oz.\n- Fiona Victory also appeared in the 1997 film Swept from the Sea.\n- Lightning McQueen is an anthropomorphic stock car character in the Pixar film Cars (2006).\n- Lightning McQueen also appears in Cars 2 (2011), Cars 3 (2017), and the TV shorts Cars Toons.\n- Cars 3 was directed by Brian Fee, and its screenplay was written by Kiel Murray, Bob Peterson, and Mike Rich.",
